{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14066","headline":"岳祠送薛近贬官 · 耿湋","name":"岳祠送薛近贬官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枯松老柏仙山下，白帝祠堂枕古逵。\n迁客无辜祝史告，神明有喜女巫知。\n遥思桂浦人空去，远过衡阳雁不随。\n度岭梅花翻向北，回看不见树南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}